<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n78900" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παράτᾰσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρατείνω</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>extension</i> or
				<i>continuance of</i> or <i>in time</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>P.</u>
				3.107
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
				<u>Tetr.</u>
				75
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρονικὴ π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>Inst.</u>
				50
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιθυμία . . μετὰ προκοπῆς τινος καὶ
					παρατάσεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Stoic.</u>
					3.96
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τοῦ ἐνεστῶτος</span>
			<i>continuance</i> of the present, <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Synt.</u>
				252.4
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν παρατάσει γενέσθαι τοῦ
				τρέχειν</span>
			<i>continue</i> to run, ib.<i><span class="en">
				273.17
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰ ἐν π. χρόνου τὸ εὐδαιμονεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plot.
					1.5t
				</span></i>
			it. ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρ᾽ ὃ ἡ κίνησις τὴν π.
				ἔχει</span>, of time, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				3.7.8
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				3.6.17
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἀεί φαμεν παράτασιν ἔχειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dam.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					298
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. δοῦναί τισι</span> grant them an
				<i>extension</i> of time for payment, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PTeb.</u>
				37.8
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">i B. C.</span>, pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>extension in space, long stretch</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ
				τῶν ἐντέρων π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>PA</u>
				677b37
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>Myst.</u>
				1.9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>direction of extension, dimension</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἓξ π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				9.367
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> Gramm.,
				<i>time of the tempus imperfectum</i> (cf.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρατατικός</span>), <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Synt.</u>
				70.27
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				472.22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				19.28
			</span></i> ; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνεστὼς χρόνος</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Adv.</u>
				124.5
			</span></i>.</div>
